        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Fox News Specialists, Cashin' In\n- People: Eric Bolling, Katherine Timpf, Eboni Williams\n- Companies: Fox News Channel, Fox Business Channel\n- Topics: American news and talk shows, current events, political issues\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Eric Bolling took over as host of the Fox Business Channel news program \"Cashin' In.\"\n- From May 1 to September 7, 2017, \"The Fox News Specialists\" aired on the Fox News Channel as an American news and talk show.\n- \"The Fox News Specialists\" featured permanent hosts Eric Bolling, Katherine Timpf, and Eboni Williams.\n- \"The Fox News Specialists\" also included two rotating guests called specialists.\n- The specialists on \"The Fox News Specialists\" discussed current events and political issues.",
